# Privacy Policy – Pörssisähkö App

**Last updated:** August 10, 2026

Pörssisähkö App ("the app") is built with full commitment to user privacy. This policy explains how data is handled by the app.

### 1. Data Collection & Processing
**Pörssisähkö App does not collect, store, transmit, or sell any personal data.** No user accounts or registrations are required.

### 2. Local Storage
All app configurations (such as Shelly IP addresses, price thresholds, custom schedules, and tariff settings) are stored **exclusively on your local device**. This data is never sent to external servers or to the developer.

### 3. Network Usage
The app establishes network connections solely to:
1. **Fetch Public Electricity Spot Prices:** Retrieves public Nord Pool price data via public APIs (e.g. Elering). No personal identifiers are attached to these requests.
2. **Control Local Shelly Devices:** Communicates directly with Shelly devices over your local Wi-Fi network.

### 4. Analytics & Tracking
The app **does not use** any third-party tracking, advertising identifiers (`AD_ID`), or analytics services..
